{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"子范畴"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"子范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>子范畴是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cat","text":"$\\mathsf{Cat}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 子范畴就是满足如下条件的函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$F$ 给出"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal D^{\\simeq}$;</li>\n<li>对任意两个对象 $X,Y\\in\\mathcal C$, 映射 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),F(Y))$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ol>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 这本质上是因为用于探测对象的 $[0]$ 和用于探测态射的 $[1]$ 构成 $\\mathsf{Cat}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"稠密子范畴","text":"稠密子范畴"}},{"Plain":". 详见 "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisRozenblyumI","text":"AFR"}},{"Plain":" Lemma 5.6.</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>要求上述条件 1 中的态射为等价, 称之为"},{"Local":{"url":"宽子范畴","text":"宽子范畴"}},{"Plain":" (wide subcategory);</li>\n<li>要求上述条件 2 中的态射为等价, 称之为"},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全子范畴"}},{"Plain":" (full subcategory).</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}